      "description": "The new per-lock cap still allows `48,780` inputs, and the pending queue retains up to `500` full locks. At 36 bytes per outpoint, the input vectors alone can retain about 0.88 GB, enough to exhaust memory on a resource-constrained client. An unknown cycle takes the pending path without proving the signature.",
